                                "sense_id": "6c62e075-9118-3874-bb25-a21717fff0cb",
                                "text": "All mammals have insulas that read their body condition, Dr. Craig said."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "10199fb3-f863-4d7a-92ac-b12b5f30559a",
                                "sense_id": "6c62e075-9118-3874-bb25-a21717fff0cb",
                                "text": "The insula registers our physical gut feelings, including the sensation of a distended stomach and other inner states like nausea, warmth, a full bladder, and a pounding heart."
